{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2021-02-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'FORD TO DISCUSS RESULTS FOR FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2020 WITH J.P. MORGAN SECURITIES', 'text': "DEARBORN, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SENIOR LEADERS FROM FORD WILL DISCUSS THE FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2020 OPERATING ENVIRONMENT AND THE COMPANY'S FINANCIAL RESULTS, WHICH WILL BE RELEASED THIS THURSDAY, DURING A FIRESIDE CHAT HOSTED BY J.P. MORGAN SECURITIES AUTO ANALYST RYAN BRINKMAN. THE DISCUSSION WILL TAKE PLACE TUESDAY, FEB. 9 AT 11 A.M. EST. THE DISCUSSION WILL ALSO FOCUS ON FORD'S ELECTRIFICATION STRATEGY, GLOBAL REDESIGN, 2021 OUTLOOK, AND UPDATES ON RECENTLY LAUNCHED PRODUCTS LIKE"}